<v Don Shirley>And so you think, oh, this is just a little puddle that doesn't go anywhere. But when you take the duckweed off the top, it's actually clear water.
<v Don Shirley>所以你以为，噢，这只是个死水坑，通向哪里。但当你把表面的浮萍拨开，其实是清澈的水。

