00:23:13.510 --> 00:23:31.580
<v Don Shirley>And if you go into this puddle, there's a small slot that goes through, which is just wide enough for a man's body to go through. After 20 foot, you're now starting to enter the cave. And gradually the cave gets wider.
<v Don Shirley>如果你进入这个水坑，有一个很窄的裂缝，刚好够一个人穿过。走过20英尺后，你开始进入洞穴。慢慢地，洞穴变宽了。

