00:29:11.960 --> 00:29:25.110
<v Don Shirley>And at 6:15, Dave went under the water. I followed 14 minutes later.
<v Don Shirley>6点15分，Dave下潜入水。我14分钟后跟着下潜。

00:29:25.110 --> 00:29:30.370
<v Julia Dewitt>Don followed the shot line down through the slot and into the cave.
<v Julia Dewitt>Don沿着引导绳穿过裂缝进入洞穴。

00:29:30.370 --> 00:29:42.810
<v Don Shirley>So whilst I was going down, falling through this black space, I was expecting to see some rising bubbles as I was going down. Also, I would see Dave's light where he was coming back.
<v Don Shirley>当我下潜，穿过这个黑暗空间时，我本以为能看到一些上升的气泡。我还应该能看到Dave回来时的灯光。

