00:31:15.220 --> 00:31:29.770
<v Don Shirley>The surface is not somewhere that you can actually go to solve a problem. When you have a problem, you have to solve that problem there where you are. And if you don't solve that problem, you don't come back. You have to put the brakes on, as it were, at that point.
<v Don Shirley>水面不是你遇到问题时可以逃去解决的地方。当你遇到问题，你必须在你所在的地方解决它。如果你解决不了，你就回不来。你必须在那个点上踩刹车，可以说。

00:31:29.770 --> 00:31:38.840
<v Don Shirley>And I was thinking, OK, Dave might come back. He's either dead or he's working his way back. But all I could deal with was what was in front of me.
